       merely manipulate data structures.  The  routine  wwrreeffrreesshh  copies  the
       named  window  to  the _p_h_y_s_i_c_a_l _s_c_r_e_e_n, taking into account what is al‐
       ready there to do optimizations.  The rreeffrreesshh routine is the same,  us‐
